[data-types.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/data-types.mdc) - Common data type rules

- All shared types and Zod schemas are defined in `next-app/lib/definitions.ts`
- Import types using: `import type { TypeName } from '@/lib/definitions'`
- Available types include: `UserType`, `UserSettingsType` (and others as they're added)
- Server Actions should export their own state types (e.g., `LoginFormState`, `SignupFormState`)
